{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel about memories and stars.<br>Set in a fantastical world of constellations, it tells the story of a journey guided by fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he awakens, he finds himself lying alone on a beach beneath a sky full of stars.<br>The sound of the waves greets him, and so does the voice of a mysterious traveler.<br>According to the traveler, these constellations will not last much longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by the traveler, he sets out on a journey across the realm of stars.<br>Along the way, he encounters people born from the constellations, each carrying their own memories and feelings that leave a lasting mark on his heart.<br>In time, he must face two questions: <i>What is the true nature of this world?</i><br>And <i>what choice has fate entrusted to him?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957390?t=1769844719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957390/febca5f11d9fc31abcbb71f70e96e0fa8fac82c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769844719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957390/c21f3c69f67ce220eb5052b5b50e0d995a642cd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769844719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957390/c21f3c69f67ce220eb5052b5b50e0d995a642cd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769844719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel about memories and stars.<br>Set in a fantastical world of constellations, it tells the story of a journey guided by fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he awakens, he finds himself lying alone on a beach beneath a sky full of stars.<br>The sound of the waves greets him, and so does the voice of a myste